{"seq":4,"slug":"koin-alternative","title":"Koin 替代方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/koin-alternative","wordCount":721,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"koin-替代方案\">Koin 替代方案</h1><p>Koin 是一个轻量级的 Kotlin 依赖注入框架，采用 DSL 声明式语法，不依赖代码生成或注解处理。对于中小型项目或偏好简洁配置的团队，Koin 是 Hilt/Dagger 的优秀替代方案。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Koin 围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>纯 Kotlin DSL 声明</strong>：用 <code>module { }</code> 与 <code>single</code> / <code>factory</code> / <code>scoped</code> / <code>viewModelOf</code> 描述依赖，无需注解处理器，<code>get()</code> 按类型自动解析。</li>\n<li><strong>运行时解析</strong>：依赖在运行时按图解析，编译快、上手平缓，但错误延迟到运行期暴露（Koin Annotations 3.5+ 可补上编译时验证）。</li>\n<li><strong>模块化组织</strong>：按功能拆分 Module，<code>startKoin</code> 汇总、<code>includes</code> 组合，<code>scope&lt;T&gt;</code> 表达作用域内单例。</li>\n<li><strong>与 Hilt 的取舍</strong>：Hilt 编译时安全、Google 推荐、适合大型企业项目；Koin 简洁快速、适合中小项目。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dsl-声明\">DSL 声明</h2><p>Koin 使用 Kotlin DSL 声明依赖关系，语法直观且易于理解。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val networkModule = module {&#10;    single {&#10;        OkHttpClient.Builder()&#10;            .connectTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)&#10;            .addInterceptor(get&lt;AuthInterceptor&gt;())&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    single {&#10;        Retrofit.Builder()&#10;            .baseUrl(&quot;https://api.example.com/&quot;)&#10;            .client(get())&#10;            .addConverterFactory(Json.asConverterFactory(&quot;application/json&quot;.toMediaType()))&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    single { get&lt;Retrofit&gt;().create(ArticleApi::class.java) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val repositoryModule = module {&#10;    single&lt;ArticleRepository&gt; { ArticleRepositoryImpl(get(), get()) }&#10;    single&lt;UserRepository&gt; { UserRepositoryImpl(get()) }&#10;    factory { GetArticlesUseCase(get()) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val viewModelModule = module {&#10;    viewModelOf(::ArticleListViewModel)&#10;    viewModelOf(::ArticleDetailViewModel)&#10;    viewModelOf(::UserProfileViewModel)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val networkModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OkHttpClient.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .connectTimeout(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addInterceptor(get&#x3C;AuthInterceptor>())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Retrofit.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .baseUrl(\"https://api.example.com/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .client(get())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addConverterFactory(Json.asConverterFactory(\"application/json\".toMediaType()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single { get&#x3C;Retrofit>().create(ArticleApi::class.java) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val repositoryModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single&#x3C;ArticleRepository> { ArticleRepositoryImpl(get(), get()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single&#x3C;UserRepository> { UserRepositoryImpl(get()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    factory { GetArticlesUseCase(get()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val viewModelModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModelOf(::ArticleListViewModel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModelOf(::ArticleDetailViewModel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModelOf(::UserProfileViewModel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Koin DSL 关键字对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DSL</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>等价 Hilt 注解</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>single</code></td>\n<td>单例</td>\n<td><code>@Singleton</code> + <code>@Provides</code></td>\n<td>全局唯一实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>factory</code></td>\n<td>每次新建</td>\n<td>无作用域的 <code>@Provides</code></td>\n<td>每次注入创建新实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scoped</code></td>\n<td>作用域内单例</td>\n<td><code>@ActivityScoped</code> 等</td>\n<td>在指定作用域内共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>viewModelOf</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel</td>\n<td><code>@HiltViewModel</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel 工厂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Koin 的 <code>single</code> 和 <code>factory</code> 使用 <code>get()</code> 函数解析依赖，Koin 会自动根据类型匹配。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"module-声明与组织\">Module 声明与组织</h2><p>大型项目中应按功能划分 Module，保持清晰的模块结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MyApplication : Application() {&#10;&#10;    override fun onCreate() {&#10;        super.onCreate()&#10;&#10;        startKoin {&#10;            androidLogger(Level.DEBUG)&#10;            androidContext(this@MyApplication)&#10;            modules(&#10;                networkModule,&#10;                databaseModule,&#10;                repositoryModule,&#10;                viewModelModule,&#10;                featureModules&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val databaseModule = module {&#10;    single {&#10;        Room.databaseBuilder(&#10;            androidContext(),&#10;            AppDatabase::class.java,&#10;            &quot;app_database&quot;&#10;        ).build()&#10;    }&#10;    single { get&lt;AppDatabase&gt;().articleDao() }&#10;    single { get&lt;AppDatabase&gt;().userDao() }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val featureModules = module {&#10;    includes(&#10;        homeModule,&#10;        searchModule,&#10;        profileModule&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;val homeModule = module {&#10;    scope&lt;HomeActivity&gt; {&#10;        scoped { HomeNavigator(get()) }&#10;        viewModelOf(::HomeViewModel)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyApplication : Application() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startKoin {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            androidLogger(Level.DEBUG)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            androidContext(this@MyApplication)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modules(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                networkModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                databaseModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                repositoryModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                viewModelModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                featureModules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val databaseModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Room.databaseBuilder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            androidContext(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppDatabase::class.java,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"app_database\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ).build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single { get&#x3C;AppDatabase>().articleDao() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single { get&#x3C;AppDatabase>().userDao() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val featureModules = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    includes(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        homeModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        searchModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        profileModule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val homeModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scope&#x3C;HomeActivity> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scoped { HomeNavigator(get()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelOf(::HomeViewModel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[startKoin] --&gt; B[networkModule]&#10;    A --&gt; C[databaseModule]&#10;    A --&gt; D[repositoryModule]&#10;    A --&gt; E[viewModelModule]&#10;    A --&gt; F[featureModules]&#10;    F --&gt; G[homeModule]&#10;    F --&gt; H[searchModule]&#10;    F --&gt; I[profileModule]&#10;&#10;    classDef koinStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A koinStyle\">graph TD\n    A[startKoin] --&gt; B[networkModule]\n    A --&gt; C[databaseModule]\n    A --&gt; D[repositoryModule]\n    A --&gt; E[viewModelModule]\n    A --&gt; F[featureModules]\n    F --&gt; G[homeModule]\n    F --&gt; H[searchModule]\n    F --&gt; I[profileModule]\n\n    classDef koinStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A koinStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lazy-与-eager-注入\">Lazy 与 Eager 注入</h2><p>Koin 支持多种注入方式，满足不同场景需求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleListActivity : AppCompatActivity() {&#10;&#10;    private val viewModel: ArticleListViewModel by viewModel()&#10;&#10;    private val analytics: AnalyticsTracker by inject()&#10;&#10;    private val logger: Logger by inject { parametersOf(&quot;ArticleList&quot;) }&#10;&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ArticleListScreen(&#10;    viewModel: ArticleListViewModel = koinViewModel()&#10;) {&#10;    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;&#10;    LazyColumn {&#10;        items(uiState.articles) { article -&gt;&#10;            ArticleItem(article = article)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val parameterizedModule = module {&#10;    factory { (tag: String) -&gt; Logger(tag) }&#10;    factory { (userId: String) -&gt; UserSession(userId, get()) }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleListActivity : AppCompatActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val viewModel: ArticleListViewModel by viewModel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val analytics: AnalyticsTracker by inject()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val logger: Logger by inject { parametersOf(\"ArticleList\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ArticleListScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModel: ArticleListViewModel = koinViewModel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LazyColumn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items(uiState.articles) { article -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ArticleItem(article = article)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val parameterizedModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    factory { (tag: String) -> Logger(tag) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    factory { (userId: String) -> UserSession(userId, get()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注入方式对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>by inject()</code></td>\n<td>委托属性</td>\n<td>首次访问时</td>\n<td>Activity/Fragment 中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>get()</code></td>\n<td>直接获取</td>\n<td>调用时立即获取</td>\n<td>Module 内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>by viewModel()</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel 委托</td>\n<td>首次访问时</td>\n<td>Activity/Fragment 中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>koinViewModel()</code></td>\n<td>Composable</td>\n<td>组合时</td>\n<td>Compose 中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>parametersOf()</code></td>\n<td>传参注入</td>\n<td>注入时</td>\n<td>需要运行时参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"koin-与-hilt-对比\">Koin 与 Hilt 对比</h2><p>两个框架各有优势，选择取决于项目规模和团队偏好。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Hilt 方式&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object NetworkModule {&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideApi(retrofit: Retrofit): ArticleApi =&#10;        retrofit.create(ArticleApi::class.java)&#10;}&#10;&#10;@HiltViewModel&#10;class ArticleViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val repository: ArticleRepository&#10;) : ViewModel()&#10;&#10;// Koin 方式&#10;val networkModule = module {&#10;    single&lt;ArticleApi&gt; { get&lt;Retrofit&gt;().create(ArticleApi::class.java) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val viewModelModule = module {&#10;    viewModelOf(::ArticleViewModel)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Hilt 方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object NetworkModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideApi(retrofit: Retrofit): ArticleApi =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        retrofit.create(ArticleApi::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: ArticleRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Koin 方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val networkModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    single&#x3C;ArticleApi> { get&#x3C;Retrofit>().create(ArticleApi::class.java) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val viewModelModule = module {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModelOf(::ArticleViewModel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Hilt</th>\n<th>Koin</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖解析</td>\n<td>编译时</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误发现</td>\n<td>编译时报错</td>\n<td>运行时崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>是（注解处理器）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译速度</td>\n<td>较慢（kapt/ksp）</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>陡峭（Dagger 概念）</td>\n<td>平缓（纯 Kotlin DSL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>稍好（编译时优化）</td>\n<td>稍差（运行时反射）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compose 支持</td>\n<td><code>hiltViewModel()</code></td>\n<td><code>koinViewModel()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google 推荐</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（但社区广泛使用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多模块支持</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>通过 <code>includes</code> 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试支持</td>\n<td><code>@UninstallModules</code></td>\n<td><code>declare</code> / <code>loadModules</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{项目选择?} --&gt; B{项目规模?}&#10;    B --&gt;|大型/企业级| C[推荐 Hilt]&#10;    B --&gt;|中小型| D{团队经验?}&#10;    D --&gt;|熟悉 Dagger| C&#10;    D --&gt;|偏好简洁| E[推荐 Koin]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; F[编译时安全]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Google 支持]&#10;    E --&gt; H[快速上手]&#10;    E --&gt; I[零代码生成]&#10;&#10;    classDef choiceStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,B,D choiceStyle\">graph TD\n    A{项目选择?} --&gt; B{项目规模?}\n    B --&gt;|大型/企业级| C[推荐 Hilt]\n    B --&gt;|中小型| D{团队经验?}\n    D --&gt;|熟悉 Dagger| C\n    D --&gt;|偏好简洁| E[推荐 Koin]\n\n    C --&gt; F[编译时安全]\n    C --&gt; G[Google 支持]\n    E --&gt; H[快速上手]\n    E --&gt; I[零代码生成]\n\n    classDef choiceStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,B,D choiceStyle</pre><p>Koin 的验证测试确保模块配置正确：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class KoinModuleVerificationTest : KoinTest {&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun checkAllModules() {&#10;        koinApplication {&#10;            androidContext(ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext())&#10;            modules(&#10;                networkModule,&#10;                databaseModule,&#10;                repositoryModule,&#10;                viewModelModule&#10;            )&#10;        }.checkModules()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class KoinModuleVerificationTest : KoinTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun checkAllModules() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        koinApplication {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            androidContext(ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modules(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                networkModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                databaseModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                repositoryModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                viewModelModule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }.checkModules()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Koin 3.5+ 引入了 <code>ksp</code> 编译时验证功能（Koin Annotations），可以在编译时检查依赖图的完整性，弥补了运行时解析的不足。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Koin 使用 Kotlin DSL 声明依赖，语法简洁，无需注解处理器</li>\n<li><code>single</code>、<code>factory</code>、<code>scoped</code> 分别对应单例、工厂和作用域内单例</li>\n<li><code>by inject()</code> 在 Android 组件中使用，<code>koinViewModel()</code> 在 Compose 中使用</li>\n<li>Hilt 适合大型项目（编译时安全），Koin 适合中小项目（快速开发）</li>\n<li><code>checkModules()</code> 测试可以验证 Koin 模块配置的正确性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Koin 替代方案","id":"koin-替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DSL 声明","id":"dsl-声明"},{"level":2,"text":"Module 声明与组织","id":"module-声明与组织"},{"level":2,"text":"Lazy 与 Eager 注入","id":"lazy-与-eager-注入"},{"level":2,"text":"Koin 与 Hilt 对比","id":"koin-与-hilt-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hilt 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/testing-with-hilt"},"next":{"title":"Retrofit 与 OkHttp","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/retrofit-and-okhttp"}}